OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy in the evening with
OL,7,Fshowers and a few clear intervals.
OL,8,FShowers turning lighter overnight
OL,9,Fthrough could be a bit wintry over
OL,10,Fhigher ground of Shetland. Northerly
OL,11,Fbreeze easing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FIt will be a bright and
OL,14,Fmainly dry day with some sunny spells.
OL,15,FOne or two light showers are still
OL,16,Fpossible. Light to moderate north to
OL,17,Fnortheast breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
